  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">P-DDRCS Pilot Project to Support the Stabilization of Bantu and Twa Communities in the Village of Lambo Katenga, in the Tanganyika Province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the consolidation of peace, reconciliation, and reconstruction of socio-economic activities in the province of Tanganyika through the stabilization of Bantu and Twa communities, the improvement of security, and access to basic services. This project will also focus on improving the living conditions of beneficiaries through access to agricultural and economic opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
